---
title: Baby Spinach, Orange & Date Salad
author: Jonathan Simmonds
servings: 6
---

Combine @baby spinach{} with @dates{6-10}(sliced) and @oranges{1-2}(peeled and sliced) in a bowl.

Add @red onion{1/2}(finely diced) and top with @?sunflower seeds{} or @?toasted hazelnuts{}.

In a small bowl, whisk together @extra virgin olive oil{2%tbsp}, @orange juice{2%tbsp}, @apple cider vinegar{1%tbsp}, and @dijon mustard{1/2%tsp}.

Pour the dressing over the salad and toss to combine.
